<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>배정고등학교 AI 스마트 분리수거 안내 시스템</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        .scan-line {
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(34,197,94,0) 0%, rgba(34,197,94,1) 50%, rgba(34,197,94,0) 100%);
            animation: scan 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes scan {
            0% { top: 0%; opacity: 0.8; }
            50% { top: 95%; opacity: 1; }
            100% { top: 0%; opacity: 0.8; }
        }
        .hide-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .hide-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 font-sans text-slate-800 antialiased min-h-screen pb-20 md:pb-6">
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto min-h-screen bg-white shadow-xl relative flex flex-col border-x border-slate-100">
        <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-700 to-teal-700 text-white p-4 sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-md">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span class="bg-white text-emerald-800 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">배정고등학교</span>
                    <h1 class="text-base font-bold flex items-center">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf text-amber-300 mr-1.5"></i>스마트 분리수거 AI
                    </h1>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>
        <main class="flex-1 p-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center space-y-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-recycle"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">배정고 스마트 분리수거 시스템</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">index.html 파일이 정상적으로 등록되었습니다!<br>교내 분리수거함 안내 시스템을 시작합니다.</p>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
